WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.792 --> 00:00:09.816
The best color to complement the elegance of a hanbok is, hands down, natural brown.

2
00:00:10.152 --> 00:00:16.728
Hair that's too black can look harsh and dated, while overly bleached hair can look cheap.

3
00:00:17.064 --> 00:00:24.672
Cool-toned skin looks brightest with chocolate brown or soft black, while warm-toned skin glows most with a warm mocha brown.

4
00:00:25.008 --> 00:00:33.024
Since hair color has a real effect on your complexion, choosing a shade that matches your personal color helps not just for the wedding but every day.
